        "candidate_id": "C_84d8637e26c77ccf_0",
        "edit": "Completed the incomplete if statement in the combinational always block by adding the missing else branch (y=b when s is not 0), so the 2:1 mux selects b for s=1 instead of leaving y unassigned.",
        "lens_id": "generic_v1",
        "replacement_rtl": "module mux21(a,b,s,y);\n\tinput a,b,s;\n\toutput y;\n\treg y;\n\talways @(a,b,s)\n\tbegin\n\t\tif(s==1'B0)begin y=a;end\n\t\telse begin y=b;end\n\tend\nendmodule",
